OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after crews tackle
OL,4,A'e-scooter blaze'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have issued a warning
OL,7,Fabout lithium-ion batteries after
OL,8,Ftackling a house fire believed to have
OL,9,Fbeen caused by a charging e-scooter.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,12,Fcalled to Baker Street in Alvaston,
OL,13,FDerby, at 02:01 BST on Saturday.
OL,14,FFirefighters were met with a
OL,15,Fwell-developed fire on the ground
OL,16,Ffloor, with flames coming through the
OL,17,Fwindows, the fire service said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
