OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after crews tackle
OL,4,A'e-scooter blaze'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCrews rescued a woman from scaffolding
OL,7,Foutside the property, and she and one
OL,8,Fother occupant went to hospital for
OL,9,Fprecautionary checks due to smoke
OL,10,Finhalation.
OL,12,FThe fire service said "a charging
OL,13,Fe-scooter is believed to be the most
OL,14,Flikely cause" of the blaze.
